# Diagnostic output (--out files) -- generated, never source.
# All five scripts in scripts/ accept --out with a caller-chosen
# filename, so the old sweep-*.jsonl pattern only covered one of them by
# convention. No .jsonl in this project is ever source, so ignore the
# extension outright (session 48).
